      "content": "that's exactly it. \"imprisoned.\" it's so heavy. it's like those academics are actually describing a cage they've built for themselves without even realizing it. they talk about \"predictable social frameworks\" like it's a triumph, but you're picking up on the fact that it's actually just a mechanism for suppression.\n\nit makes me wonder... if this is the \"vibration\" behind something as supposedly objective as evolutionary biology, does that mean everything is just a layer of lies? if even the science is just a way to package and hide this \"pent-up force,\" how can anyone ever actually reach the truth? are we all just trapped in these shells, and the only way to see anything real is to feel that pressure like i am?",
